{"id":70692,"date":"2026-10-24T23:26:00","date_gmt":"2026-10-24T22:26:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70692"},"modified":"2026-10-25T00:16:38","modified_gmt":"2026-10-24T23:16:38","slug":"meia-maratona-porto","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-porto\/","title":{"rendered":"Hyundai Meia Maratona do Porto 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Hyundai Meia Maratona do Porto 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Hyundai Meia Maratona do Porto 2027<\/strong> j\u00e1 tem data oficial confirmada para o dia <strong>19 de Setembro de 2027<\/strong> (Domingo), regressando \u00e0 cidade do <strong>Porto<\/strong> para mais uma edi\u00e7\u00e3o de uma das mais emblem\u00e1ticas e internacionais provas de estrada em Portugal.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Dedicada \u00e0 dist\u00e2ncia cl\u00e1ssica de <strong>21 km<\/strong> (21,097 km), a corrida destaca-se pelo tra\u00e7ado r\u00e1pido e plano junto \u00e0s margens do <strong>rio Douro<\/strong>, ligando a frente ribeirinha da Invicta e de <strong>Vila Nova de Gaia<\/strong> num cen\u00e1rio hist\u00f3rico marcado pela <strong>Ponte Lu\u00eds I<\/strong> e pela zona da <strong>Ribeira<\/strong>. Para planeares a tua prepara\u00e7\u00e3o, podes calcular os teus ritmos na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">Calculadora de Pace<\/a> e consultar a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/tabela-paces-meia-maratona\/\">Tabela de Paces de Meia Maratona<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com organiza\u00e7\u00e3o a cargo da <strong>Runporto<\/strong>, o evento re\u00fane milhares de atletas nacionais e estrangeiros na procura de recordes pessoais na dist\u00e2ncia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\">Meia Maratona<\/a> e afirma-se como um dos grandes destaques do calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-porto\/\">corridas no Porto<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color